---
/** Pull-quote style parent narrative preview */
---

<aside class="narrative-quote relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-caira-navy px-8 py-10 text-white md:px-12 md:py-14">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-caira-cyan/20 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-12 -left-8 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-caira-teal/25 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="relative grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr,auto] lg:items-center lg:gap-12">
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-caira-cyan">What parents receive</p>
      <blockquote class="ai-sample mt-4 text-xl leading-relaxed text-white/95 md:text-2xl">
        "Mia had a wonderful afternoon exploring sensory play. She described the texture of
        sand as 'crunchy' and invited a friend to build alongside her — a lovely step in
        social-emotional growth aligned with this week's GELDS strand."
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-white/55">
        AI-generated daily narrative · reviewed by staff · tied to approved observations
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5 backdrop-blur">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-caira-teal text-sm font-bold text-white">
          M
        </span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Mia's family</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-white/50">Preschool · Tuesday 6:42 PM</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <span class="rounded-full bg-caira-teal/30 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-caira-mint">Daily story</span>
        <span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white/70">GELDS-linked</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>
